/td></tr> <tr><td><code>587</code></td><td><?= __('客户端提交发信') ?></td><td><?= __('STARTTLS（推荐）') ?></td></tr> <tr><td><code>465</code></td><td><?= __('客户端提交发信（可选）') ?></td><td><?= __('隐式 TLS') ?></td></tr> <tr><td><code>993</code></td><td><?= __('客户端收信') ?></td><td><code>IMAPS</code></td></tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </div> </div> <div class="w-card mail-setup-guide__step"> <div class="w-card__body"> <h6 class="w-card__title"><?= __('3. 执行真实收发验收') ?></h6> <ol class="mail-setup-guide__checklist"> <li><?= __('创建两个测试邮箱账号 A 和 B，验证 A→B 与 B→A 均能收到。') ?></li> <li><?= __('向 QQ、Gmail 或 Outlook 等外部邮箱发送，并从外部邮箱回复。') ?></li> <li><?= __('检查外部收件邮件头，确认 SPF、DKIM 和 DMARC 均为 pass。') ?></li> <li><?= __('未登录 SMTP 时尝试向外域转发，必须被拒绝，以确认服务器不是开放中继。') ?></li> <li><?= __('测试中文主题、正文和附件，确认内容、编码与附件均完整。') ?></li> <li><?= __('验证 587 STARTTLS、可选 465 和 993 的证书链、主机名及加密连接。') ?></li> </ol> <div class="w-alert" data-tone="warning" style="--w-mt:var(--weline-space-4);"><?= __('全部通过后再逐步提高发信额度；DNS 或 DKIM 未通过时不要开放大批量发信。') ?></div> </div> </div> </div> </details> <w:form class="w-grid" method="get" action="@var($this->getBackendUrl('weline_mail/backend/index'))" data-align="end" style="--w-row-gap:var(--weline-space-2);--w-column-gap:var(--weline-space-2);"> <div style="--w-span-md:5;"> <label class="w-field__label"><?= __('邮箱域名') ?></label> <input class="w-input" name="domain" value="<?= $escape($dnsResult['domain'] ?? '') ?>" placeholder="example.com"> </div> <div style="--w-span-md:5;"> <label class="w-field__label"><?= __('邮件主机名') ?></label> <input class="w-input" name="hostname" value="<?= $escape($dnsResult['hostname'] ?? '') ?>" placeholder="mail.example.com"> </div> <div style="--w-span-md:2;"> <button class="w-button" type="submit" data-w-width="full" data-tone="neutral"><?= __('检测') ?></button> </div> </w:form> <?php if ($dnsResult): ?> <div class="w-table-wrap" style="--w-mt:var(--weline-space-4);"> <table class="w-table"> <thead> <tr> <th><?= __('类型') ?></th> <th><?= __('主机') ?></th> <th><?= __('建议值') ?></th> <th><?= __('状态') ?></th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <?php foreach ($dnsResult['records'] as $record): ?> <tr> <td><?= $escape($record['type'] ?? '') ?></td> <td><?= $escape($record['host'] ?? '') ?></td> <td style="white-space: normal;"><?= $escape($record['value'] ?? '') ?></td> <td><?= !empty($record['ok']) ? __('存在') : __('未检测到') ?></td> </tr> <?php endforeach; ?> </tbody> </table> </div> <?php endif; ?> </div> </div> </div> <div style="--w-span-lg:4;"> <div class="w-card"> <div class="w-card__body"> <h5 class="w-card__title"><?= __('客户端配置') ?></h5> <?php if ($clientSettings): ?> <div class="w-table-wrap"> <table class="w-table"> <tbody> <tr><th>SMTP</th><td><?= $escape($clientSettings['smtp']['host'] ?? '') ?>:<?= (int)($clientSettings['smtp']['port'] ?? 0) ?> <?= $escape($clientSettings['smtp']['security'] ?? '') ?></td></tr> <tr><th>IMAP</th><td><?= $escape($clientSettings['imap']['host'] ?? '') ?>:<?= (int)($clientSettings['imap']['port'] ?? 0) ?> <?= $escape($clientSettings['imap']['security'] ?? '') ?></td></tr> <tr><th>POP3</th><td><?= $escape($clientSettings['pop3']['host'] ?? '') ?>:<?= (int)($clientSettings['pop3']['port'] ?? 0) ?> <?= $escape($clientSettings['pop3']['security'] ?? '') ?></td></tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <?php else: ?> <p class="w-text" data-tone="muted"><?= __('输入域名和邮件主机名后显示客户端连接配置。') ?></p> <?php endif; ?> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="w-grid"> <div style="--w-span:12;"> <div class="w-card"> <div class="w-card__body"> <h5 class="w-card__title"><?= __('Fake 邮件审计') ?></h5> <p class="w-text" data-tone="muted"><?= __('显示最近 20 封 fake 模式写入的收件箱和发件箱邮件，用于后台冒烟核对。') ?></p> <div class="w-table-wrap"> <table class="w-table" data-w-vertical="middle"> <thead> <tr> <th>ID</th> <th><?= __('账号ID') ?></th> <th><?= __('邮件箱') ?></th> <th><?= __('发件人') ?></th> <th><?= __('收件人') ?></th> <th><?= __('主题') ?></th> <th><?= __('投递状态') ?></th> <th><?= __('时间') ?></th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <?php if ($messages === []): ?> <tr><td colspan="8" class="w-text" data-tone="muted"><?= __('暂无 fake 邮件记录') ?></td></tr> <?php else: ?> <?php foreach ($messages as $message): ?> <tr> <td><?= (int)$message->getId() ?></td> <td><?= (int)$message->getData('account_id') ?></td> <td><?= $escape($message->getData('folder')) ?></td> <td><?= $escape($message->getData('from_email')) ?></td> <td><?= $escape($message->getData('to_email')) ?></td> <td><?= $escape($message->getData('subject')) ?></td> <td><?= $escape($message->getData('delivery_status')) ?></td> <td><?= $escape($message->getData('created_at')) ?></td> </tr> <?php endforeach; ?> <?php endif; ?> </tbody> </table> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>
</div> <script>
(function () { var domainOptions = <?= $domainOptionsJson ?>; var searchInput = document.getElementById('mail-domain-search'); var hiddenInput = document.getElementById('mail-domain-hidden'); var resultBox = document.getElementById('mail-domain-results'); var selectedName = document.getElementById('mail-selected-domain-name'); var selectedMeta = document.getElementById('mail-selected-domain-meta'); var hostInput = document.getElementById('mail-domain-hostname'); var engineSelect = document.getElementById('mail-domain-engine'); var domainSubmit = document.getElementById('mail-domain-submit'); var accountDomainSelect = document.getElementById('mail-account-domain-select'); var accountDomainSuffix = document.getElementById('mail-account-domain-suffix'); var accountQuota = document.getElementById('mail-account-quota'); var accountStatus = document.getElementById('mail-account-status'); var accountFilter = document.getElementById('mail-account-domain-filter'); function normalize(value) { return String(value || '').trim().toLowerCase(); } function isFakeDomain(domain) { return domain.endsWith('.test') || domain.endsWith('.invalid'); } function escapeHtml(value) { return String(value || '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, function (char) { return {'&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;', "'": '&#039;'}[char]; }); } function renderDomainOptions() { var query = normalize(searchInput.value); var filtered = domainOptions.filter(function (item) { if (!query) { return true; } return normalize(item.domain).indexOf(query) !== -1 || normalize(item.source_domain).indexOf(query) !== -1 || normalize(item.source).indexOf(query) !== -1; }).slice(0, 14); if (!filtered.length) { resultBox.innerHTML = '<div class="w-text" data-tone="muted" style="--w-pt:var(--weline-space-4);--w-pe:var(--weline-space-4);--w-pb:var(--weline-space-4);--w-ps:var(--weline-space-4);"><?= $escape(__('暂无匹配域名，可输入 .test / .invalid 域名做 Fake 冒烟')) ?></div>'; return; } resultBox.innerHTML = filtered.map(function (item) { var created = item.is_created ? '<span class="w-badge ms-2" data-w-background="success"><?= $escape(__('已开通')) ?></span>' : ''; var sourceDomain = item.source_domain && item.source_domain !== item.domain ? '<span class="w-text ms-2" data-tone="muted">' + escapeHtml(item.source_domain) + '</span>' : ''; var accountText = item.is_created ? '<?= $escape(__('账号数')) ?> ' + Number(item.account_count || 0) : '<?= $escape(__('未开通')) ?>'; return '<button type="button" class="mail-domain-option" data-domain="' + escapeHtml(item.domain) + '">' + '<div><span class="mail-domain-name">' + escapeHtml(item.domain) + '</span>' + created + sourceDomain + '</div>' + '<div class="mail-muted-line">' + escapeHtml(item.source || '') + ' · ' + escapeHtml(item.website_status || '') + ' · ' + accountText + '</div>' + '</button>'; }).join(''); } function findDomainOption(domain) { domain = normalize(domain); for (var i = 0; i < domainOptions.length; i++) { if (normalize(domainOptions[i].domain) === domain) { return domainOptions[i]; } } return null; } function selectDomain(domain) { domain = normalize(domain); var option = findDomainOption(domain); hiddenInput.value = domain; searchInput.value = domain; if (!hostInput.value || hostInput.dataset.auto === '1') { hostInput.value = domain ? 'mail.' + domain : ''; hostInput.dataset.auto = '1'; } if (domain) { engineSelect.value = isFakeDomain(domain) ? 'fake' : 'stalwart'; } if (option) { selectedName.textContent = option.domain; selectedMeta.textContent = (option.source || '') + (option.is_created ? ' · <?= $escape(__('已开通')) ?>' : ' · <?= $escape(__('可开通')) ?>'); domainSubmit.disabled = !!option.is_created; } else { selectedName.textContent = domain || '<?= $escape(__('尚未选择域名')) ?>'; selectedMeta.textContent = domain ? '<?= $escape(__('手动测试域名')) ?>' : '<?= $escape(__('请搜索并选择一个域名')) ?>'; domainSubmit.disabled = false; } Array.prototype.forEach.call(resultBox.querySelectorAll('.mail-domain-option'), function (button) { button.classList.toggle('is-selected', normalize(button.getAttribute('data-domain')) === domain); }); } if (searchInput && resultBox) { renderDomainOptions(); searchInput.addEventListener('input', function () { var value = normalize(searchInput.value); hiddenInput.value = value; if (!hostInput.value || hostInput.dataset.auto === '1') { hostInput.value = value ? 'mail.' + value : ''; hostInput.dataset.auto = '1'; } if (value) { var exact = findDomainOption(value); if (exact) { selectDomain(value); } else { selectedName.textContent = value; selectedMeta.textContent = '<?= $escape(__('手动测试域名')) ?>'; domainSubmit.disabled = false; } } renderDomainOptions(); }); resultBox.addEventListener('click', function (event) { var button = event.target.closest('.mail-domain-option'); if (!button) { return; } selectDomain(button.getAttribute('data-domain')); }); hostInput.addEventListener('input', function () { hostInput.dataset.auto = '0'; }); document.getElementById('mail-domain-create-form').addEventListener('submit', function () { hiddenInput.value = normalize(hiddenInput.value || searchInput.value); }); } function syncAccountDomainDefaults() { if (!accountDomainSelect) { return; } var option = accountDomainSelect.options[accountDomainSelect.selectedIndex]; var domain = option ? option.getAttribute('data-domain') : ''; var engine = option ? option.getAttribute('data-engine') : ''; accountDomainSuffix.textContent = domain ? '@' + domain : '@'; if (option && option.getAttribute('data-quota')) { accountQuota.value = option.getAttribute('data-quota'); } if (accountStatus) { accountStatus.value = engine === 'fake' ? 'active' : 'pending'; } } if (accountDomainSelect) { accountDomainSelect.addEventListener('change', syncAccountDomainDefaults); syncAccountDomainDefaults(); } function filterAccountRows() { if (!accountFilter) { return; } var domainId = accountFilter.value; Array.prototype.forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll('#mail-account-table-body tr[data-domain-id]'), function (row) { row.classList.toggle('mail-row-hidden', domainId && row.getAttribute('data-domain-id') !== domainId); }); } if (accountFilter) { accountFilter.addEventListener('change', filterAccountRows); filterAccountRows(); }
})();
